\n$$\n\\text{Var}[X]=\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2}\n$$\n\nAdditionally, we're given that $\\text{E}[X]=2.$ \n\nWe start by computing $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}].$ Summing up the products of each value of ${X}^{2}$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{2}] & ={0}^{2}\\cdot f(0)+{2}^{2}\\cdot f(2)+{4}^{2}\\cdot f(4) \\\\  & =4\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}+16\\cdot \\frac{1}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{20}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{20}{3}-{2}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[\\sqrt{3}X] & =3\\cdot \\text{Var}[X] \\\\  & =3\\cdot \\frac{8}{3} \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425507 1058 #edb/ref 17592186425511 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425507 1062 #uuid "0925688f-b14f-5497-b2f8-ef5577ee74ea" 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425507 1063 #edb/ref 17592186425505 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425508 1058 #edb/ref 17592186425509 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425508 1062 #uuid "1bca5d11-c663-5970-a2d7-41fbabf9a6af" 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425508 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162267 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425509 1058 #edb/ref 17592186425507 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425509 1062 #uuid "2775e72e-c277-5c4c-8f6b-b21b5d18a293" 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425509 1063 #edb/ref 17592186425506 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425510 1058 #edb/ref 17592186425508 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425510 1062 #uuid "53444b7f-e4a7-573c-87a7-c9522567fb10" 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425510 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162264 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425511 1062 #uuid "e8ab5da7-93a7-56c3-964a-5c487de36ed5" 13194139534555 17592186045417 true] [17592186425511 1063 #edb/ref 17592186420137 13194